{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oops! A monkey has stolen your blown-out wig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to make it to your blind date tonight, use your umbrella to defeat the wind and obstacles and get your wig back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/e74a4e264ad8909e8faa2eac32fc176e.avif?t=1771343951\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/321a336e5cdb0b4b398337238bce3b13.poster.avif?t=1771343951\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/321a336e5cdb0b4b398337238bce3b13.webm?t=1771343951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/321a336e5cdb0b4b398337238bce3b13.mp4?t=1771343951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your umbrella as it flails in the wind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, it will fly backwards if you leave a certain angle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/3e309ccd78973eda29067c51bca8fb39.avif?t=1771343951\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/41670bf4eabc4a2b67807b49ac1226ea.poster.avif?t=1771343951\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/41670bf4eabc4a2b67807b49ac1226ea.webm?t=1771343951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/41670bf4eabc4a2b67807b49ac1226ea.mp4?t=1771343951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over the many obstacles that stand in your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't be easy, but you can do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/6d514e0616d997f8b5589026d3183b74.avif?t=1771343951\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/75bd58e9f32f127774e30f738aa0c6b4.poster.avif?t=1771343951\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/75bd58e9f32f127774e30f738aa0c6b4.webm?t=1771343951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/75bd58e9f32f127774e30f738aa0c6b4.mp4?t=1771343951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkeys and monkey-obsessed villains stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of terrain and enemy patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/c7b8ceba2a24da0f003bfb1ad6501814.avif?t=1771343951\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678760/extras/3ca2b82469895ba1fd